; --- The Wet Hull at her berth ---------------------------------------------------
; The dock complex IS the shop: Sedge trades out of the hull moored against it, which is why she
; stands at the shore end of the pier rather than in a building. It reads at a glance as the one
; structure on the water, and 38K's rule that a merchant needs a place to be standing is answered
; without a single new model.
[node name="DockComplex" type="Node3D" parent="Nav"]
